1. PROJECT IDENTITY AND PURPOSE

EducaTurdi (also referred to as "EDUTRDI" or "EDUTRD") is an educational
software project designed to provide a digital environment for students,
teachers, administrators, and related educational workflows.

The MIT License above applies to the software and source code covered by this
repository. It is intended to allow use, study, modification, and
redistribution of that code under the terms of the MIT License.

